  "About": {
    "title": "ABOUT US – Vaazhga Malamud Property Hub",
    "header": "About Us – Vaazhga Malamud Property Hub",
    "description": "Welcome to **Vaazhga Valamudan – Property Hub**, Tamil Nadu's most **smart, transparent, and people-first** real estate marketplace.\n\nWe are not just a listing platform; we are a **dedicated digital ecosystem** built for and by the people of Tamil Nadu. Our mission is simple: to make property dealings **easy, secure, and accessible** for everyone—from individual owners in rural villages to professional promoters managing large projects.\n\n## Our Commitment to You:\n\nWe connect property buyers, sellers, agents, and promoters on one trusted digital space where:\n\n* Every listing is **verified** using robust authentication tools (like Aadhaar for agents)\n* Every agent is **accountable**, providing quality information and professional service\n* Every search is **focused**, covering both major cities and underserved rural areas\n\nWhether you're an agent selling a single plot or a promoter managing multiple housing projects, **Vaazhga Valamudan** provides the tools you need to reach serious, verified buyers across the state and among the NRI community—without middlemen, confusion, or hidden costs.\n\nWe combine modern technology, verified data, and Tamil-friendly support to bring genuine opportunities to every user.\n\n### Our Motto:\n\n**\"Grow together, succeed together — Vaazhga Valamudan!\"**\n\n*(Our True Success is all of us Lives with Prosperity.)*",
    "explore_more": "EXPLORE MORE"
  },
